{"parentUuid":"745ad20a-5870-4f18-8ed1-d0fdc27eed34","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfkB9FqPiLJqarLkP6Bwx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's the phrase:\n\n> **\"First I review what has already been published to find what's missing, then I build something that fills that gap and test whether it works, and the thesis is written from both parts.\"**\n\nHow that maps to your repo:\n- **\"review what has already been published to find what's missing\"** is `sls/`, the systematic literature study (protocol → search → reading → synthesis → gap).\n- **\"build something that fills that gap and test whether it works\"** is `dsrm/`, design science (problem → objectives → design → demonstration → evaluation, repeating the build-and-test steps).\n- **\"the thesis is written from both parts\"** is the chapter table in `research/README.md`.\n\nFor a more academic listener who still isn't from the field:\n\n> \"A systematic literature review finds the gap, and a design science process builds and evaluates a solution to it.\""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4784,"cache_read_input_tokens":38134,"output_tokens":349,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":85},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4784,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":349,"cache_read_input_tokens":38134,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4784,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4784},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ce5b1284-b22d-4d1d-a6ad-abb33ce22aa6","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011