{"parentUuid":"83b92432-c9d2-44ff-a9d8-c3a6a0cd0a31","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfkykjmkkcuoLoVU8XD9e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You're right. The table was ordered by method, not by when things happen. The real first step is **DSRM 1.1, the observation**. SLS 1 is only first inside the SLS.\n\nThe cause is that DSRM step 1 runs in two passes:\n- **1.1 Observation:** before any literature. It starts the SLS.\n- **1.2–1.5 Motivation, stakeholders, design problem, RQs:** after SLS 5, because Peffers requires knowing the state of the problem.\n\nSo the whole order is:\n\n| # | Step | Agent | You decide |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 0 | DSRM 1.1 Observation | none | The observation |\n| 1 | SLS 1 Protocol | `protocol-critic` | SQs, criteria, checklist, form |\n| 2 | SLS 2 Search | `snowballer` | Include/exclude |\n| 3 | SLS 3 Reading | `reader` | Corrected records, key papers read in full |\n| 4 | SLS 4 Synthesis | `synthesizer` | Concepts, comparisons |\n| 5 | SLS 5 Gap | `synthesizer` | The gap |\n| 6 | DSRM 1.2–1.5 Problem | `skeptic` | Problem, design problem, RQs |\n| 7 | DSRM 2 Objectives | `skeptic` | Objectives, metrics, baselines |\n| 8 | DSRM 3 Design | `designer`, `builder` | Design choices, accepting each layer |\n| 9 | DSRM 4 Demonstration | `demonstrator` | Plan, \"solved\" |\n| 10 | DSRM 5 Evaluation | `evaluator`, `skeptic` | Met / not met, next iteration |\n| 11 | DSRM 6 Communicate | `drafter`, `examiner` | Outline, claims, wording |\n\nSteps 2–4 loop until a round adds no new papers, and steps 8–10 loop until the objectives are met. `citation-checker`, the AI log and `just check` apply throughout.\n\nThere's also an honesty problem in your repo: `dsrm/1-problem/step.md` 1.2–1.5 is already filled in, from your prior knowledge, before any SLS. That's normal, but it should be labelled a provisional draft that SLS 5 will confirm or revise. Otherwise the record shows the problem coming before the literature, against your own stated order.\n\nThe repo layout could reflect this better too. The cleanest option is to move 1.1 into its own `research/0-observation.md`, so `dsrm/1` holds only what comes after the review. Should I make that move, along with writing `agents.md`?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":37949,"cache_read_input_tokens":23077,"output_tokens":1196,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":314},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":37949,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1196,"cache_read_input_tokens":23077,"cache_creation_input_tokens":37949,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":37949},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}},"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ce7dfb6b-9e54-4354-bdb4-f921150d5038","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfkykj4qQT6M73bjEWYQq","type":"assistant","uuid":"dbb40f52-c062-4301-bb12-8dd917a33a94","timestamp":"2026-10-06T12:25:26.072Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f5479a1a-28cc-4c2d-bc70-ca6abee30b5e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/garro/dev/faculty/Thesis","sessionId":"f5479a1a-28cc-4c2d-bc70-ca6abee30b5e","version":"2.1.289","gitBranch":"main"}
