{"parentUuid":"bfa7fd53-6e78-43d5-9773-0f690a257a98","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfm3KoUm1fJ5xpEwSTuTy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QLn9jwwJxm4ySjzQDDwZxx","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/garro/dev/faculty/Thesis/research/ai/skills.md","content":"# Skills\n\nThree levels of facades. Every skill can be called on its own.\n\n```\nthesis                      entry point → route through sls and dsrm\n├── sls                     runs SLS 1 → 5, with the snowballing loop\n│   ├── sls-1-protocol\n│   ├── sls-2-search\n│   ├── sls-3-reading\n│   ├── sls-4-synthesis\n│   └── sls-5-gap\n└── dsrm                    runs DSRM 1 → 6, with the design loop\n    ├── dsrm-1-problem\n    ├── dsrm-2-objectives\n    ├── dsrm-3-design\n    ├── dsrm-4-demonstration\n    ├── dsrm-5-evaluation\n    └── dsrm-6-communicate\n```\n\n- **`thesis`** asks for the entry point (`entry-points.md`) and calls `sls` and `dsrm` in the order that entry point needs.\n- **`sls`** and **`dsrm`** run their steps in order, handle their loops, and stop at every gate.\n- **Step skills** run the rows of their step (`flow-sls.md`, `flow-dsrm.md`): they call the agents, then stop at the gate. Called directly, they work on the files that exist (e.g. `sls-3-reading P12` reads one paper).\n- **Skills are procedures, agents are workers.** Step skills call agents (`agents.md`); agents never call skills.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":910,"cache_read_input_tokens":91017,"output_tokens":8241,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":910,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_t