{"parentUuid":"42b2f119-1d01-4acc-abc2-27580981177b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2419a529-f839-4a01-8c3d-f915f75e005c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QLn9jwwJxm4ySjzQDDwZxx","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /home/garro/dev/faculty/Thesis/research/ai/skills.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"ca697b31-d7f8-40da-be3d-3e572aea59fd","timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:12:57.919Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/home/garro/dev/faculty/Thesis/research/ai/skills.md","content":"# Skills\n\nThree levels of facades. Every skill can be called on its own.\n\n```\nthesis                      entry point → route through sls and dsrm\n├── sls                     runs SLS 1 → 5, with the snowballing loop\n│   ├── sls-1-protocol\n│   ├── sls-2-search\n│   ├── sls-3-reading\n│   ├── sls-4-synthesis\n│   └── sls-5-gap\n└── dsrm                    runs DSRM 1 → 6, with the design loop\n    ├── dsrm-1-problem\n    ├── dsrm-2-objectives\n    ├── dsrm-3-design\n    ├── dsrm-4-demonstration\n    ├── dsrm-5-evaluation\n    └── dsrm-6-communicate\n```\n\n- **`thesis`** asks for the entry point (`entry-points.md`) and calls `sls` and `dsrm` in the order that entry point needs.\n- **`sls`** and **`dsrm`** run their steps in order, handle their loops, and stop at every gate.\n- **Step skills** run the rows of their step (`flow-sls.md`, `flow-dsrm.md`): they call the agents, then stop at the gate. Called directly, they work on the files that exist (e.g. `sls-3-reading P12` reads one paper).\n- **Skills are procedures, agents are workers.** Step skills call agents (`agents.md`); agents never call skills.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"42b2f119-1d01-4acc-abc2-27580981177b","session_id":"f5479a1a-28cc-4c2d-bc70-ca6abee30b5e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/garro/dev/faculty/Thesis/research","