{"parentUuid":"9d872ecf-8b89-4bff-9cad-d77451e1c2b2","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2419a529-f839-4a01-8c3d-f915f75e005c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Jw44V13PJDWyHdq7chNJWH","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /home/garro/dev/faculty/Thesis/research/ai/kickstart.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"601505e6-c030-44bf-bad7-8345929352d8","timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:12:58.103Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/home/garro/dev/faculty/Thesis/research/ai/kickstart.md","content":"# Kickstart\n\nThe pipeline starts from my provisional draft: step 0. For the problem-centred route (`entry-points.md`):\n\n| # | Who | Input | Output | Gate |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **0** | Me | — | `dsrm/1-problem/`: `observation.md`, `motivation.md`, `H{n}.md`, `stakeholders.md`, `design-problem.md`, `RQ{n}.md`, all `provisional` | — |\n\n## Safeguards\nThat draft already argues for a conclusion, so:\n- **Protocol bias:** SQs drawn only from my hypotheses would only look for support. `skeptic` adds SQs that look for evidence against them (row 1b, `flow-sls.md`).\n- **Start set bias:** snowballing only from my own references mostly finds more of the same. The start set also uses a database search string (row 2a), as Wohlin recommends a varied start set [1].\n\n## Closing the loop\nAt the end of the SLS, the loop returns to step 0: the `synthesizer` lists which claims are confirmed, need revising or are contradicted (row 6a, `flow-dsrm.md`), and I revise the draft before setting it to `accepted`.\n\n---\n\n## References\n1. Wohlin (2014). *Guidelines for Snowballing in Systematic Literature Studies*. Conference on Evaluation and Assessment in Software Engineering.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9d872ecf-8b89-4bff-9cad-d77451e1c2b2","session_id":"f5479a1a-28cc-4c2d-bc70-ca6abee30b5e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/garro/dev/faculty/Thesis/research","sessionId":"f5479a1a-28cc-4c2d-bc70-ca6abee30b5e","version":"2.1.289","gitBranch":"main"}
