{"parentUuid":"996d5569-53e1-4bbc-9c9a-e9be8a43480f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfm3Q8HiB1kcz7fCPBkt5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I split `research/agents.md` into ten files in `research/ai/`, each under 45 lines, and deleted the old file. Nothing is committed.\n\n| File | Holds |\n|---|---|\n| `README.md` | The line, an index of the files, the reading order |\n| `skills.md` | The facade tree (`thesis` → `sls` / `dsrm` → step skills) |\n| `agents.md` | The 12 agents, and what the builder produces at each layer |\n| `entry-points.md` | Peffers' four entry points and the route from each |\n| `kickstart.md` | Step 0, the two bias safeguards, and the loop back to step 0 |\n| `files.md` | The small-files rules and the frontmatter |\n| `flow-sls.md` | Rows 1a–5c |\n| `flow-dsrm.md` | Rows 6a–11e |\n| `ai-log.md` | The raw log and the per-gate decision files |\n| `checks.md` | `just check` and `just views` |\n\n**Choices to look at:**\n- I named the folder `ai/` rather than `agents/`, because agents are now only one of the ten files. Tell me if you'd rather have a different name.\n- The flow is split along the same line as the facade skills: one file each for SLS and DSRM. Step 0 moved to `kickstart.md`.\n- The old \"Throughout\" section became `checks.md`. Its check list now also includes the snowballing stop rule, which before appeared only in the flow table.\n- Files point to each other by name (e.g. \"see `ai-log.md`\"), so each one can be read on its own.\n\n`research/README.md` doesn't link to `ai/` yet. I'd add that link in the same change as the migration to the small-files layout."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":273,"cache_read_input_tokens":100960,"output_tokens":613,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":51},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requ