{"parentUuid":"b3b9d64d-ba2e-4f33-8df3-61fecfdfe5dc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfm459QGrtkPQyeqYGVrR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's the flow as the `ai/` files now define it, from start to finish:\n\n```\n0  You: observation (+ seeds, notes)                  0-start/\n│\n├─ SLS: what does the literature say?                  sls/\n│   1  Protocol     AI drafts → skeptic adds counter-SQs → you freeze it\n│   2  Search       AI proposes papers → you include/exclude ─┐\n│   3  Reading      AI drafts each record → checked → you accept │ repeat until\n│   4  Synthesis    AI proposes concepts → you accept          │ a round adds\n│      ↺ new papers this round? ───────────────────────────────┘ no papers\n│   5  Gap          AI drafts answers + gap → skeptic → you state the gap\n│\n└─ DSRM: build and test the solution                   dsrm/\n    1  Problem      AI drafts motivation, problem, RQs from observation + gap\n                    → skeptic → you decide\n    2  Objectives   You write objectives, metrics, baselines → skeptic → frozen\n    3  Design       AI gives options → you choose → AI builds the layer → you accept ─┐\n    4  Demonstrate  AI plans → you approve → AI runs → you confirm \"solved\"           │\n    5  Evaluate     AI measures → skeptic → you judge met / not met                   │\n       ↺ next layer or fix → 3 · objective wrong → 2 · all met → 6 ──────────────────┘\n    6  Communicate  You outline claims → AI drafts → checked + examiner → you finalize\n       ↺ writing exposes a hole → 2 or 3\n```\n\n**Every step follows the same pattern:**\n1. An agent reads specific files and writes new small files with status `proposed`.\n2. Usually `skeptic` or `citation-checker` reviews them, in files next to them.\n3. You decide at the gate. Only the status changes, and a decision file records what you did.\n4. `just check` runs.\n\n**The AI only drafts and checks.** You make 17 decisions: the protocol, every include/exclude, every record, the concepts, the gap, the problem and RQs, the objectives, every design choice and layer, the demonstration plans and their outcomes, the results, every iteration, the argument and the final text.\n\n**Where each part is defined:**\n- Step 0: `ai/kickstart.md`\n- Rows 1a–5c: `ai/flow-sls.md`\n- Rows 6a–11e: `ai/flow-dsrm.md`\n- What each agent does: `ai/agents.md`\n- File rules: `ai/files.md`\n- Logging: `ai/ai-log.md`\n\nThis diagram is the problem-centred route, which is your thesis. The other three entry points change only what step 0 holds and where DSRM starts (`ai/entry-points.md`)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":38,"cache_read_input_tokens":126723,"output_tokens":984,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":55},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":38,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":984,"cache_read_input_tokens":126723,"cache_creation_input_tokens":38,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":38},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"2eb6b495-d60b-4b37-a179-9b82ad18f6b6","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfm4593CKvgJ2rpSgneHi","type":"assistant","uuid":"fb57587d-20c3-414c-80a8-0d619fb0f786","timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:22:00.377Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"f5479a1a-28cc-4c2d-bc70-ca6abee30b5e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/garro/dev/faculty/Thesis/research/ai","sessionId":"f5479a1a-28cc-4c2d-bc70-ca6abee30b5e","version":"2.1.289","gitBranch":"main"}
