{"parentUuid":"200245f8-3484-4fa6-9d5b-2722e8f14e54","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfm4E65c3SMBELNfuzLq8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VL1h5xkAsdbzWupCQerzAy","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"T=template && mkdir -p $T/0-start $T/sls/{1-protocol,2-search,3-reading,4-synthesis,5-gap} $T/dsrm/{1-problem,2-objectives,3-design,4-demonstration,5-evaluation,6-communicate} $T/reviews $T/ai-log\n# fm <file> <id> <row> <by> <inputs>\nfm() { printf -- '---\\nid: %s\\nrow: %s\\nby: %s\\nstatus: proposed\\ninputs: [%s]\\n---\\n' \"$2\" \"$3\" \"$4\" \"$5\" > \"$1\"; }\n\n# ---------- 0-start ----------\nfm $T/0-start/observation.md observation 0 me \"\"\ncat >> $T/0-start/observation.md <<'EOF'\n# Observation\n\n{X} is true in {domain A}, but not in {domain B}.\n\n## How I noticed it\n{One paragraph: where I saw this and why it seems worth studying.}\nEOF\nfm $T/0-start/seeds.md seeds 0 me \"\"\ncat >> $T/0-start/seeds.md <<'EOF'\n# Seeds\n\nReferences I already know. Candidates for the start set (row 2a), not results.\n\n| Reference | Why I think it is relevant |\n|---|---|\n| {Authors (year). *Title*. Venue.} | {one line} |\nEOF\nfm $T/0-start/notes.md notes 0 me \"\"\ncat >> $T/0-start/notes.md <<'EOF'\n# Notes\n\n{Anything I already think about the problem, as I wrote it. Optional. Checked against the literature in row 6a, not trusted.}\nEOF\n\n# ---------- sls/1-protocol ----------\nfm $T/sls/1-protocol/need.md need 1a protocol-critic \"0-start/observation.md\"\ncat >> $T/sls/1-protocol/need.md <<'EOF'\n# Need for the review\n\n## What the review is about\n{From the observation, in two or three sentences.}\n\n## Existing reviews\n| Review | What it covers | Why it is not enough |\n|---|---|---|\n| {reference} | {scope} | {gap} |\n\n{If none were found: where I looked and with what search.}\nEOF\nfm $T/sls/1-protocol/SQ.md \"SQ{n}\" \"1a | 1b\" \"protocol-critic | skeptic\" \"0-start/observation.md\"\ncat >> $T/sls/1-protocol/SQ.md <<'EOF'\n# SQ{n}\n\n## Question\n{One question the review answers.}\n\n## Why it matters to the observation\n{One or two sentences.}\n\n## Origin\n{observation | notes | counter-evidence (added by skeptic)}\nEOF\nfm $T/sls/1-protocol/criteria.md criteria 1a protocol-critic \"0-start/observation.md, sls/1-protocol/SQ*.md\"\ncat >> $T/sls/1-protocol/criteria.md <<'EOF'\n# Selection criteria\n\n| ID | Inclusion criterion |\n|---|---|\n| I1 | {A paper is included if …} |\n\n| ID | Exclusion criterion |\n|---|---|\n| X1 | {A paper is excluded if …} |\nEOF\nfm $T/sls/1-protocol/quality.md quality 1a protocol-critic \"sls/1-protocol/SQ*.md\"\ncat >> $T/sls/1-protocol/quality.md <<'EOF'\n# Quality assessment checklist\n\n| ID | Question asked of each paper | Scale |\n|---|---|---|\n| Q1 | {question} | yes / partly / no |\nEOF\nfm $T/sls/1-protocol/extraction-form.md extraction-form 1a protocol-critic \"sls/1-protocol/SQ*.md\"\ncat >> $T/sls/1-protocol/extraction-form.md <<'EOF'\n# Data extraction form\n\nFields filled for every included paper (`sls/3-reading/P{n}.md`). Every SQ is served by at least one field.\n\n| Field | What to record | Serves |\n|---|---|---|\n| {field} | {what, with page} | SQ{n} |\nEOF\nfm $T/sls/1-protocol/change.md \"change-{date}-{slug}\" 1c me \"sls/1-protocol/{changed file}\"\ncat >> $T/sls/1-protocol/change.md <<'EOF'\n# Protocol change: {slug}\n\nSaved as `sls/1-protocol/changes/{date}-{slug}.md`.\n\n## What changed\n{File and field, before and after.}\n\n## Why\n{Reason.}\n\n## Papers affected\n{P IDs that must be re-screened or re-read, or \"none\" and why.}\nEOF\n\n# ---------- sls/2-search ----------\nfm $T/sls/2-search/search-string.md search-string 2a snowballer \"sls/1-protocol/criteria.md, sls/1-protocol/SQ*.md\"\ncat >> $T/sls/2-search/search-string.md <<'EOF'\n# Search string\n\n## String\n```\n{search string}\n```\n\n## Where and when\n| Database | Date run | Results |\n|---|---|---|\n| {database} | {date} | {count} |\nEOF\nfm $T/sls/2-search/R.md \"R{k}\" \"2a | 2c\" snowballer \"sls/1-protocol/criteria.md, {0-start/seeds.md | sls/2-search/R{k-1}*.md}\"\ncat >> $T/sls/2-search/R.md <<'EOF'\n# Round {k}: {start | backward | forward}\n\nSaved as `R0.md` (start set) or `R{k}-backward.md` / `R{k}-forward.md`.\n\n## Examined\n{P IDs whose references (backward) or citing papers (forward) were examined. For R0: seeds and search string.}\n\n## Candidates\n| Reference | Proposed | Criterion | Decision | P ID |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| {Authors (year). *Title*. Venue.} | {include / exclude} | {I_ / X_} | {set at gate 2b / 2d} | {assigned if included} |\n\n## Newly included\n{P IDs, or \"none\": the stop rule is met.}\nEOF\n\n# ---------- sls/3-reading ----------\nfm $T/sls/3-reading/P.md \"P{n}\" 3a reader \"sls/1-protocol/quality.md, sls/1-protocol/extraction-form.md\"\ncat >> $T/sls/3-reading/P.md <<'EOF'\n# P{n}\n\n## Reference\n{Authors (year). *Title*. Venue.}\n\n## Deepest pass\n{1 | 2 | 3}\n\n## First pass: the five Cs\n- **Category:** {}\n- **Context:** {}\n- **Correctness:** {}\n- **Contributions:** {}\n- **Clarity:** {}\n\n## Quality\n| Q | Answer | Why |\n|---|---|---|\n| Q1 | {yes / partly / no} | {one line} |\n\n## Extracted fields\n| Field | Value | Page |\n|---|---|---|\n| {field from extraction-form.md} | {value} | {p.} |\n\n## Concepts\n| Concept | What the paper says | Page |\n|---|---|---|\n| {C{n} or new concept} | {one line} | {p.} |\n\n## Notes\n{Anything else, or \"none\".}\nEOF\n\n# ---------- sls/4-synthesis ----------\nfm $T/sls/4-synthesis/C.md \"C{n}\" 4a synthesizer \"sls/3-reading/P*.md\"\ncat >> $T/sls/4-synthesis/C.md <<'EOF'\n# C{n}: {concept}\n\n## Definition\n{One or two sentences.}\n\n## First found in\nP{n}\n\n## What the papers say, compared\n{Agreements, disagreements, how far each gets, with P IDs and pages. The matrix itself is generated in `views/`.}\nEOF\n\n# ---------- sls/5-gap ----------\nfm $T/sls/5-gap/SQ.answer.md \"SQ{n}.answer\" 5a synthesizer \"sls/1-protocol/SQ{n}.md, sls/4-synthesis/C*.md\"\ncat >> $T/sls/5-gap/SQ.answer.md <<'EOF'\n# Answer to SQ{n}\n\n## Answer\n{}\n\n## Evidence\n{P IDs and pages.}\n\n## How strong\n{What is well supported, what rests on few or weak papers.}\nEOF\nfm $T/sls/5-gap/gap.md gap 5a synthesizer \"sls/4-synthesis/C*.md, sls/5-gap/SQ*.answer.md\"\ncat >> $T/sls/5-gap/gap.md <<'EOF'\n# Gap\n\n## Not covered\n{Concepts or combinations of concepts no paper covers, with the C IDs.}\n\n## Covered only in part\n{What exists and where it stops, with P IDs.}\nEOF\nfm $T/sls/5-gap/solutions.md solutions 5a synthesizer \"sls/4-synthesis/C*.md\"\ncat >> $T/sls/5-gap/solutions.md <<'EOF'\n# Current solutions\n\n| Solution | P IDs | How far it gets | What it lacks |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| {} | {} | {} | {} |\nEOF\nfm $T/sls/5-gap/history.md history 5a synthesizer \"sls/4-synthesis/C*.md\"\ncat >> $T/sls/5-gap/history.md <<'EOF'\n# History\n\nWhy it has not been done, or why earlier attempts failed.\n\n| Attempt | P IDs | What happened | Why, according to the sources |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| {} | {} | {} | {with pages} |\nEOF\nfm $T/sls/5-gap/limitations.md limitations 5a synthesizer \"sls/1-protocol/*.md, sls/2-search/*.md\"\ncat >> $T/sls/5-gap/limitations.md <<'EOF'\n# Limitations of this review\n\n| Limitation | How it could bias the result |\n|---|---|\n| {e.g. one database, English only, seeds chosen by me} | {} |\nEOF\n\n# ---------- dsrm/1-problem ----------\nfm $T/dsrm/1-problem/motivation.md motivation 6a synthesizer \"0-start/*.md, sls/5-gap/*.md\"\ncat >> $T/dsrm/1-problem/motivation.md <<'EOF'\n# Motivation\n\n## Why solving it matters\n- **{Point}.** {Claim, with P IDs.}\n\n## Why it has not been done, or why earlier attempts failed\n{Summary of `sls/5-gap/history.md`, with P IDs.}\nEOF\nfm $T/dsrm/1-problem/revision.md revision 6a synthesizer \"0-start/notes.md, sls/5-gap/*.md\"\ncat >> $T/dsrm/1-problem/revision.md <<'EOF'\n# Revision of my notes\n\nOnly if `0-start/notes.md` exists.\n\n| Claim in notes | Verdict | P IDs | Note |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| {quoted} | {confirmed / to revise / contradicted / not covered by the review} | {} | {} |\nEOF\nfm $T/dsrm/1-problem/design-problem.md design-problem 6b synthesizer \"0-start/*.md, dsrm/1-problem/motivation.md\"\ncat >> $T/dsrm/1-problem/design-problem.md <<'EOF'\n# Design problem\n\nTemplate (Wieringa): *Improve <a problem context> by <(re)designing an artifact> that satisfies <some requirements> in order to <help stakeholders achieve some goals>.*\n\nImprove {problem context} by designing {artifact} that satisfies {requirements} in order to help {stakeholders from stakeholders.md} {achieve goals}.\nEOF\nfm $T/dsrm/1-problem/RQ.md \"RQ{n}\" 6b synthesizer \"dsrm/1-problem/design-problem.md, sls/5-gap/gap.md\"\ncat >> $T/dsrm/1-problem/RQ.md <<'EOF'\n# RQ{n}\n\n## Question\n{}\n\n## Type (Shaw)\n{method or means of development | method for analysis or evaluation | design, evaluation or analysis of a particular instance | generalization or characterization | feasibility study or exploration}\n\n## Why the answer could be \"no\"\n{}\n\n## Evidence that would answer it\n{What kind of result. Metrics and baselines are defined in `dsrm/2-objectives/`.}\nEOF\nfm $T/dsrm/1-problem/H.md \"H{n}\" 6b synthesizer \"dsrm/1-problem/motivation.md, sls/5-gap/history.md\"\ncat >> $T/dsrm/1-problem/H.md <<'EOF'\n# H{n}: {short name}\n\n## Hypothesis\n{What I believe is different now. Not a result.}\n\n## Basis\n{P IDs.}\n\n## Tested by\nRQ{n}\nEOF\nfm $T/dsrm/1-problem/stances.md stances 6b synthesizer \"0-start/*.md, dsrm/1-problem/design-problem.md\"\ncat >> $T/dsrm/1-problem/stances.md <<'EOF'\n# Design stances\n\nWhat this thesis deliberately does not solve.\n\n| Stance | Why | Counter-evidence to address |\n|---|---|---|\n| {} | {} | {P IDs, or \"none found\"} |\nEOF\nfm $T/dsrm/1-problem/stakeholders.md stakeholders 6b synthesizer \"0-start/*.md, dsrm/1-prob