ocol (need, SQs, criteria, quality checklist, extraction form) from step 0. Dispatched by the sls-1-protocol skill. (Tools: Read, Write, Glob, Grep, WebSearch, WebFetch)","- reader: Thesis SLS row 3a. Reads one included paper and drafts its record (five Cs, quality, extracted fields, concepts, with pages). Dispatched by the sls-3-reading skill, one per paper. (Tools: Read, Write, Glob, Grep, WebFetch, Bash)","- skeptic: Thesis rows 1b, 5b, 6c, 7b, 10b. Attacks claims, review questions, the gap, the problem, objectives and results, and looks for counter-evidence. Dispatched by any step skill. (Tools: Read, Write, Glob, Grep, WebSearch, WebFetch)","- snowballer: Thesis SLS rows 2a and 2c. Proposes the search string and start set, then fetches backward (references) and forward (citations) candidates per round and pre-screens each against the criteria. Dispatched by the sls-2-search skill. (Tools: Read, Write, Glob, Grep, WebSearch, WebFetch, Bash)","- synthesizer: Thesis rows 4a, 5a, 6a, 6b. Builds concepts from paper records, drafts SQ answers and the gap, then drafts the DSRM problem (motivation, design problem, RQs, hypotheses, stances, stakeholders) from step 0 and the gap. Dispatched by sls-4-synthesis, sls-5-gap and dsrm-1-problem. (Tools: Read, Write, Glob, Grep)"],"builtInTypes":[],"removedTypes":[],"isInitial":false,"showConcurrencyNote":false},"type":"attachment","uuid":"940d6118-d58f-417c-96f3-0be7470e4a28","timestamp":"2026-10-06T13:43:13.935Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nNew agent types are now available for the Agent tool:\n- builder: Thesis DSRM row 8c. Builds one artifact layer (paper design spec, simulator code and tests, formal model, or HDL) from the accepted design decisions, runs its checks, and describes it. Dispatched by the dsrm-3-design skill. (Tools: Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep, Bash)\n- citation-checker: Thesis rows 3b and 11c. Checks that each cited claim appears in its source at the cited page, quoting the passage. Dispatch